  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>c</mi></math> are in arithmetic progression and one root of the equation <math><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is <math><mn>2,</mn></math> then the other root is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "KfmZm",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
